{"4851130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tsushima Incremental", "steam_appid": 4851130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and grow your own feudal Japanese settlement in a relaxing incremental game. Unlock new production buildings, optimize your economy, and expand your territory as your village grows into a thriving domain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvest Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood, stone, food, and other essential resources to keep your settlement running. Balance production chains and improve efficiency as new challenges emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/54e17925def5814b2490173d3316102f.poster.avif?t=1784327324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/54e17925def5814b2490173d3316102f.webm?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/54e17925def5814b2490173d3316102f.mp4?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process raw materials into valuable goods and craft equipment to strengthen your economy and prepare your armies for conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/3f7aeece845c7a23825d657bcf4f2a2b.poster.avif?t=1784327324\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/3f7aeece845c7a23825d657bcf4f2a2b.webm?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/3f7aeece845c7a23825d657bcf4f2a2b.mp4?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an active clicker experience or let your settlement prosper while you are away. Return to collect resources, unlock upgrades, and continue expanding at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/080df1a70d9ae8f9901a194c018b5326.poster.avif?t=1784327324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/080df1a70d9ae8f9901a194c018b5326.webm?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/080df1a70d9ae8f9901a194c018b5326.mp4?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer New Lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit soldiers, build your army, and conquer neighboring settlements. Claim new territories, and establish your rule across the land.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and grow your own feudal Japanese settlement in a relaxing incremental game. Unlock new production buildings, optimize your economy, and expand your territory as your village grows into a thriving domain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvest Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wood, stone, food, and other essential resources to keep your settlement running. Balance production chains and improve efficiency as new challenges emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/54e17925def5814b2490173d3316102f.poster.avif?t=1784327324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/54e17925def5814b2490173d3316102f.webm?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/54e17925def5814b2490173d3316102f.mp4?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process raw materials into valuable goods and craft equipment to strengthen your economy and prepare your armies for conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/3f7aeece845c7a23825d657bcf4f2a2b.poster.avif?t=1784327324\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/3f7aeece845c7a23825d657bcf4f2a2b.webm?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/3f7aeece845c7a23825d657bcf4f2a2b.mp4?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an active clicker experience or let your settlement prosper while you are away. Return to collect resources, unlock upgrades, and continue expanding at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/080df1a70d9ae8f9901a194c018b5326.poster.avif?t=1784327324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/080df1a70d9ae8f9901a194c018b5326.webm?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/extras/080df1a70d9ae8f9901a194c018b5326.mp4?t=1784327324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer New Lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit soldiers, build your army, and conquer neighboring settlements. Claim new territories, and establish your rule across the land.</p>", "short_description": "Tsushima Incremental lets you build and manage a thriving village, develop a robust economy, and enjoy a relaxing idle experience. Master your resources, upgrade your settlement, and equip your clan to conquer new lands.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/66c848d1cc36f40ca33bda9780c383c2eed12960/header.jpg?t=1784327324", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/63e199b75be45f28d1191487928d0795ea6dc553/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784327324", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4851130/63e199b75be45f28d1191487928d0795ea6dc553/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784327324", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 Ti Mobile 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 30 FPS at 1080p on High presets, 100 FPS at 1080p on Low presets.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s